# Sync demo → ramp-vue and ship

When syncing `pay-sdk-mvp/demo` into `ramp-vue/public/demo`:

1. Copy/sync files into `ramp-vue/public/demo`.
2. **Commit** ramp-vue changes immediately (no need to wait for another ask).
3. **Push** to the current remote tracking branch.

Keep the commit message short and why-focused. No force-push.
